        <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ddb1"/>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Data registered by mechanical or electronic means, in a form that allows the information to be retrieved and/or reproduced. For example, images or sounds on disc or magnetic tape. [Source: Adapted from https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/ModeOfCollection_3.0.html]</skos:definition>
